To make this worse, even if we store our internal ID in our AbstractAgent instance the run handler mutates our agent instance

```typescript
export async function handleRunAgent({
  runtime,
  request,
  agentId,
}: RunAgentParameters) {
...
    // Ensure the clone carries the registry key so InMemoryAgentRunner can
    // tag historic runs with the correct agentId for filtering.
    agent.agentId = agentId;
```

